    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>.In the year <strong>XX39</strong>, a <strong>giant leek</strong> collided with the earth.<br>The giant leek pierced the <strong>miraculous planet, <strong>Earth</strong>, and tilted the earth's axis <strong>39 degrees</strong>.<br><strong>Hatsune Miku</strong>, who came with Negi, plans to turn Earth into Negi's planet.<br>Humanity creates anti-negi weapons to stop them.<br>Your <strong>objective</strong> is only one.<br><strong>Become Miku Hatsune and turn the earth into a planet of green onions! </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hatsune Miku</h2>.Hatsune Miku has completed her long, long journey in a green onion-shaped spaceship. Let's terrorize the humans in order to rule the earth!<br><br><strong>Grow your hair</strong>! <strong>Destroy buildings</strong>!<br>You can invade as you see fit.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/ed035ae4b21d2102fa5085e34d5b3666.poster.avif?t=1711113661\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/ed035ae4b21d2102fa5085e34d5b3666.webm?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/ed035ae4b21d2102fa5085e34d5b3666.mp4?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2>!As you proceed with your invasion, you will discover humans. The humans have their own lives, some join suspicious parties, others indulge in prayer. What you do with them is up to you. You can make them your friends, or you can...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/495eb233fec24f32e228ff58530f8422.poster.avif?t=1711113661\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/495eb233fec24f32e228ff58530f8422.webm?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/495eb233fec24f32e228ff58530f8422.mp4?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items</h2>.Items may fall when buildings are destroyed. Make use of the characteristics of each item for your invasion!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/1ff596256cf64454dc25c290dd4dcde2.poster.avif?t=1711113661\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/1ff596256cf64454dc25c290dd4dcde2.webm?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/1ff596256cf64454dc25c290dd4dcde2.mp4?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fighting the Enemy</h2>.As you explore, you may encounter hostile creatures. Use items and other items to kick them to the curb!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/5a366394467af2d7f31029d4b01f1a44.poster.avif?t=1711113661\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/5a366394467af2d7f31029d4b01f1a44.webm?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/5a366394467af2d7f31029d4b01f1a44.mp4?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>As you progress further, you may encounter more powerful bosses...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/a6af1f78c09174d3a1ba51221b35347f.poster.avif?t=1711113661\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/a6af1f78c09174d3a1ba51221b35347f.webm?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856870/extras/a6af1f78c09174d3a1ba51221b35347f.mp4?t=1711113661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</strong>",
